# personal run helper — local paths and shell layout, not part of the product
neuron.bat

# The chat UI's build toolchain. `/node_modules/` above is root-anchored and does NOT cover a
# nested one, so without this the 91 packages under ui/web would be committed. Node is a BUILD
# dependency only; the BUILT assets under ui/static/app/ ARE committed, because the PyInstaller
# bundle ships them and a volunteer must never need npm.
ui/web/node_modules/
